    "sentence_translations": [
      "Signature",
      "",
      "Every one of Little Ming’s homework has to be signed by the head of the family.",
      "Recently, because Little Ming’s Dad has been too busy with work, he hasn’t had the time to sign them.",
      "So he gave his own stamp to Little Ming, and let him sign them himself.",
      "",
      "After a week went by, Little Ming’s teacher gave Little Ming’s Dad a phone call, and said:",
      "“Little Ming’s Dad, has your stamp gone missing?”",
      "“The homework notebooks of more than half of the children in our class all have your formal name on them…”"
